<p>Reduces the resistances of up to five targets in a ball of radius <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">8%, 14%, 23%, 31%, 38%.</acronym></p>